# Before you judge, read all the risks

There is a company that is harder to conclude than it is to study. The data is not bad, but they are not good; technology is not no, but it is not the moat; the outlook is not non-existent, but every growth logic follows a "but." Warm technology is one of these companies.

This is a very direct one:** all the key risks are on the table and then both sides are clear and you will judge for yourself.**

