The fully-owned subsidiary of the Henwa Technology Corporation**, the Embang Insurance Brokerships Ltd.** holds insurance broker licences and is an entity operating in the insurance distribution business in Heungwa.

The company's record on the Consumer Complaints Platform is very bad:

